32
00:02:01,350 --> 00:02:07,390
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Clouds</font>

33
00:02:01,350 --> 00:02:07,390
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">are Nice...</font>

34
00:02:01,350 --> 00:02:07,390
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Guy with</font>

35
00:02:01,350 --> 00:02:07,390
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">No Interest</font>

36
00:02:07,380 --> 00:02:09,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— C'mon!
— Hurry up with the match!</font>

37
00:02:09,850 --> 00:02:10,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Finish it up already!</font>

38
00:02:13,780 --> 00:02:14,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stand up and start the match!</font>

39
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:25,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Evidently, people don't want to
see the minor players' matches</font>

40
00:02:25,750 --> 00:02:29,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">since they were really looking
forward to Sasuke's match...</font>

41
00:02:30,210 --> 00:02:33,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If people aren't expecting anything
exciting from this battle,</font>

42
00:02:33,540 --> 00:02:35,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">makes no sense
for me to have it.</font>

43
00:02:37,470 --> 00:02:40,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? You're giving up, too?</font>

44
00:02:42,850 --> 00:02:44,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My opponent's a girl again?</font>

45
00:02:46,100 --> 00:02:47,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, why aren't you moving?!</font>

46
00:02:47,430 --> 00:02:49,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">C'mon, get started!</font>

47
00:02:49,980 --> 00:02:53,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That kid has had zero fighting spirit
from the beginning...</font>

48
00:02:53,650 --> 00:02:56,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">C'mon! What is he doing?!</font>

49
00:02:56,530 --> 00:03:00,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">C'mon Shikamaru!
Get it together and do it!</font>

50
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't come, I'll go!</font>

51
00:03:06,410 --> 00:03:08,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Haven't started yet...</font>

52
00:03:08,580 --> 00:03:12,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, that girl is so gung-ho.</font>

53
00:03:29,890 --> 00:03:34,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't really matter if
I become a Chunin or not.</font>

54
00:03:35,310 --> 00:03:38,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But there's no reason why
a man should lose to a woman.</font>

55
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:41,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... let's do it!</font>

56
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:00,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy's quick to run away...</font>

57
00:04:05,340 --> 00:04:09,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nor any reason why a man should
rough up a woman.</font>

58
00:04:10,930 --> 00:04:12,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I don't want to be
roughed up either.</font>

59
00:04:13,900 --> 00:04:16,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's the kind of Ninja that
uses shadows.</font>

60
00:04:17,230 --> 00:04:18,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Possession Jutsu.</font>

61
00:04:25,620 --> 00:04:28,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's probably trying to lure me into
the trees where there're lots of shadows...</font>

62
00:04:29,410 --> 00:04:30,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I won't let him.</font>

63
00:04:31,410 --> 00:04:35,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why am I the only one who always
gets a woman for an opponent, dammit?!</font>

64
00:04:35,710 --> 00:04:42,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru! You get her with
a torrent of 16 combination...!</font>

65
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:45,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mind if I sit here?</font>

66
00:04:45,760 --> 00:04:46,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

67
00:04:46,970 --> 00:04:50,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What... you?
Your stomach okay?</font>

68
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:57,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Wasn't Sasuke's match next?</font>

69
00:04:58,400 --> 00:04:59,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shh!</font>

70
00:05:01,900 --> 00:05:06,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everything's fine, right, Sakura?
After all, it's Sasuke-kun, right?</font>

71
00:05:07,950 --> 00:05:10,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">R-Right now, I should leave her alone.</font>

72
00:05:11,910 --> 00:05:14,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like Shikamaru taking part
in this final battle,</font>

73
00:05:14,710 --> 00:05:16,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it seems like he's in the wrong place.</font>

74
00:05:16,830 --> 00:05:18,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say that!</font>

75
00:05:18,710 --> 00:05:22,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I certainly don't think that
he has any great techniques,</font>

76
00:05:22,130 --> 00:05:26,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but that Shikamaru is
always good at strategising.</font>

77
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:31,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why I feel like we ended up
in the preliminary round the other day.</font>

78
00:05:31,810 --> 00:05:33,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm, yeah well...</font>

79
00:05:33,810 --> 00:05:36,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And after all, he jumped down
into the arena himself.</font>

80
00:05:37,980 --> 00:05:40,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He seems uncharacteristically driven.</font>

81
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:44,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even he can be passionate
once in a while!</font>

82
00:05:44,610 --> 00:05:47,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go! Shikamaru!</font>

83
00:05:49,700 --> 00:05:54,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, I envy a cloud being so free...</font>

84
00:05:59,250 --> 00:06:03,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess I pretty much
am completely without desire...</font>

85
00:06:03,750 --> 00:06:05,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even the reason why I became a Ninja...</font>

86
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:09,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was because I thought
I would have a fun life, ya know...</font>

87
00:06:18,190 --> 00:06:19,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get it together!</font>

88
00:06:20,060 --> 00:06:21,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">C'mon Shikamaru!</font>

89
00:06:25,940 --> 00:06:29,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... of course, it's not that easy.</font>

90
00:06:30,660 --> 00:06:33,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on with that stupid face?!
Is he underestimating me?</font>

91
00:06:34,410 --> 00:06:35,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Wind Scythe Jutsu!</font>

92
00:06:48,970 --> 00:06:53,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right, with this attack,
my armed attacks also were beaten down.</font>

93
00:07:13,700 --> 00:07:14,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

94
00:07:21,080 --> 00:07:24,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Possession Jutsu!
I've seen that true identity!</font>

95
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:27,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Evidently there's a limit to
the stretching and shortening,</font>

96
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:30,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">changing shape of the shadow...</font>

97
00:07:31,220 --> 00:07:32,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how much you
change the shape of the shadow,</font>

98
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:33,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">even when you stretch it,</font>

99
00:07:34,050 --> 00:07:37,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it can only span up to
the size of your own shadow.</font>

100
00:07:38,850 --> 00:07:39,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right isn't it?</font>

101
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:42,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You got it...</font>

102
00:07:43,770 --> 00:07:46,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if I assume that he's made up
the distance,</font>

103
00:07:46,480 --> 00:07:50,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by stretching his shadow from the edge
of the shadow of the arena wall...</font>

104
00:07:51,070 --> 00:07:53,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the limit to how far
the shadow can stretch.</font>

105
00:07:54,620 --> 00:07:56,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the scope of his attack!</font>

106
00:07:58,080 --> 00:08:00,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">15 meters, 32 centimeters!</font>

107
00:08:01,290 --> 00:08:03,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She took the distance
with the folding fan.</font>

108
00:08:04,330 --> 00:08:07,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Temari is stronger at long distance
battles than she is at close range...</font>

109
00:08:08,050 --> 00:08:10,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the outcome has already been decided.</font>

110
00:08:35,700 --> 00:08:37,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? What is that sign...?</font>

111
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:43,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's no sign. That's like, his habit.</font>

112
00:08:44,210 --> 00:08:45,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Habit...?</font>

113
00:08:45,500 --> 00:08:52,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He enjoys passing time slowly.
That guy's like an old man.</font>

114
00:08:53,090 --> 00:08:55,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why he likes Shogi and chess</font>

115
00:08:55,510 --> 00:08:58,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and always makes me be his opponent.</font>

116
00:09:03,850 --> 00:09:06,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When he's stuck on a move,
he always does that.</font>

117
00:09:14,150 --> 00:09:15,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?</font>

118
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:18,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's working out his strategy.</font>

119
00:09:26,750 --> 00:09:30,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And, I've never beaten him.</font>

120
00:09:31,630 --> 00:09:34,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A strategy...
but this is an actual fight.</font>

121
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:36,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's different from a game.</font>

122
00:09:36,880 --> 00:09:40,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's said that formation pieces
that were used to build battle strategy</font>

123
00:09:40,140 --> 00:09:42,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">eventually become
game pieces.</font>

124
00:09:43,140 --> 00:09:46,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru is like a brilliant general.</font>

125
00:09:47,100 --> 00:09:48,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait a minute.</font>

126
00:09:48,730 --> 00:09:51,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When we grouped the Genin,
I saw his scores.</font>

127
00:09:52,270 --> 00:09:54,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They were at about the
same level of that Naruto's.</font>

128
00:09:55,610 --> 00:09:59,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He said that moving his pencil during
written exams at the academy is a pain,</font>

129
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:02,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and during the tests,
he always sleeps instead.</font>

130
00:10:02,910 --> 00:10:03,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A pain...?</font>

131
00:10:19,890 --> 00:10:24,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was so good at strategy games,
I felt something wasn't right...</font>

132
00:10:24,970 --> 00:10:28,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I had him take an IQ test
under the pretense that it was a game.</font>

133
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:36,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... how did it turn out...?</font>

134
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He was more than brilliant.</font>

135
00:10:43,780 --> 00:10:47,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With an IQ of over 200,
he's a super genius!</font>

136
00:10:48,750 --> 00:10:50,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-Two hundred?!</font>

137
00:10:58,340 --> 00:11:01,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's done thinking...
It starts now.</font>

138
00:11:13,810 --> 00:11:15,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like you've got some
fighting spirit now...</font>

139
00:11:26,790 --> 00:11:28,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's pointless to hide!</font>

140
00:11:35,460 --> 00:11:37,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if he's really got a strategy...</font>

141
00:11:38,630 --> 00:11:40,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">M-Maybe...</font>

142
00:11:48,470 --> 00:11:50,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With that he has no approach!</font>

143
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:53,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru! Go for it!</font>

144
00:11:53,650 --> 00:11:55,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's pointless, isn't it?</font>

145
00:11:55,270 --> 00:11:57,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He'll give up soon.</font>

146
00:11:57,270 --> 00:11:58,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He hates things
that are a pain in the butt.</font>

147
00:11:58,980 --> 00:12:03,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're wrong!
At least, I hope so...</font>

148
00:12:03,070 --> 00:12:05,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you may be right...</font>

149
00:12:38,610 --> 00:12:42,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How long are you going to run away!
Cut it out!</font>

150
00:12:53,160 --> 00:12:53,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no use.</font>

151
00:12:54,290 --> 00:12:56,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As long as I'm on the
outside of this line,</font>

152
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:57,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he absolutely can't catch me...</font>

153
00:12:58,540 --> 00:13:00,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, wait! Close call!</font>

154
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:10,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You caught on well.</font>

155
00:13:11,720 --> 00:13:14,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you were dragging your feet
to wait for the sun to set...</font>

156
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:17,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in order to make the surface
of your own shadow larger</font>

157
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:20,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by stretching the shadow line of the wall.</font>

158
00:13:22,740 --> 00:13:24,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As the sun goes down,
the shadows lengthen.</font>

159
00:13:25,570 --> 00:13:26,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't that so?</font>

160
00:13:31,370 --> 00:13:33,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was close! Shikamaru...</font>

161
00:13:33,870 --> 00:13:36,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But why is he using shadows?</font>

162
00:13:36,790 --> 00:13:40,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all, Shikamaru is inside
the shadow of the field.</font>

163
00:13:40,590 --> 00:13:44,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If there's even a little bit of light,
he can make a shadow within a shadow!</font>

164
00:13:44,970 --> 00:13:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't know a thing
about Shikamaru!</font>

165
00:13:49,260 --> 00:13:52,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A shadow... in a shadow...?</font>

166
00:14:01,650 --> 00:14:03,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if I calculate the height
of the sun now</font>

167
00:14:03,780 --> 00:14:06,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the limit to the distance
of the previous attack,</font>

168
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:09,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's no mistaking the distance!</font>

169
00:14:18,370 --> 00:14:20,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Temari! Up!</font>

170
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:22,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

171
00:14:24,380 --> 00:14:25,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?!</font>

172
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:29,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

173
00:14:43,070 --> 00:14:44,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you escape!</font>

174
00:14:47,950 --> 00:14:50,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't expect that he would
create extra shadows to reach me</font>

175
00:14:50,070 --> 00:14:51,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by making a parachute with his jacket...!</font>

176
00:14:55,240 --> 00:14:56,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's impressive.</font>

177
00:14:57,250 --> 00:15:01,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once I notice the parachute from above,
I'll take my attention off from my feet.</font>

178
00:15:01,920 --> 00:15:04,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a sneaky trick to catch me
off my guard!</font>

179
00:15:05,170 --> 00:15:07,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, now it's clear.</font>

180
00:15:08,050 --> 00:15:09,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Possession Jutsu is</font>

181
00:15:09,840 --> 00:15:13,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one in which other shadows are used
to get your opponent,</font>

182
00:15:13,300 --> 00:15:14,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a skillful technique!</font>

183
00:15:28,740 --> 00:15:30,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's dodged this trick too...</font>

184
00:15:31,360 --> 00:15:32,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not careful enough in the final stage.</font>

185
00:15:34,240 --> 00:15:36,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And his opponent is fairly analytical.</font>

186
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:38,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's good at thinking ahead.</font>

187
00:15:46,550 --> 00:15:48,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If this battle takes too long,</font>

188
00:15:48,130 --> 00:15:51,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the shadows in the arena will grow,
and his territory will increase.</font>

189
00:15:56,930 --> 00:15:58,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll defeat him with the next one!</font>

190
00:15:59,520 --> 00:16:02,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Should I make a diversion
with Clone Jutsu...?</font>

191
00:16:11,450 --> 00:16:13,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now his shadow is...</font>

192
00:16:15,570 --> 00:16:16,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

193
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:20,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Clone...</font>

194
00:16:23,500 --> 00:16:24,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No way...!</font>

195
00:16:30,460 --> 00:16:33,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My... body is...?!</font>

196
00:16:38,180 --> 00:16:41,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At last...
Shadow Possession Jutsu is a success!</font>

197
00:16:42,560 --> 00:16:43,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

198
00:16:49,530 --> 00:16:50,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on...?</font>

199
00:16:51,400 --> 00:16:52,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That boy...</font>

200
00:16:52,990 --> 00:16:55,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How much is he planning ahead...?</font>

201
00:16:56,200 --> 00:16:58,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's Shikamaru's skill.</font>

202
00:16:59,540 --> 00:17:02,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why... won't my body move?!</font>

203
00:17:03,120 --> 00:17:05,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The shadow shouldn't
have reached this far.</font>

204
00:17:07,880 --> 00:17:09,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll let you take a look behind you...</font>

205
00:17:20,140 --> 00:17:21,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-This hole...!</font>

206
00:17:22,520 --> 00:17:24,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You saw it too, didn't you...?</font>

207
00:17:25,520 --> 00:17:29,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That hole is the hole Naruto
burrowed and flew out of.</font>

208
00:17:30,690 --> 00:17:34,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it's connected to the
big hole in front of you.</font>

209
00:17:36,740 --> 00:17:40,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't expect that...
a shadow in a tunnel of a hole...</font>

210
00:17:41,740 --> 00:17:42,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right.</font>

211
00:17:44,120 --> 00:17:46,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pure and simple,
a calculated chess move.</font>

212
00:17:54,840 --> 00:17:58,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So his purpose to make Temari measure
the limit of the shadow several times</font>

213
00:17:58,890 --> 00:18:03,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was to lead her to his final trick
of using this hole.</font>

214
00:18:07,940 --> 00:18:10,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Temari battled on the outside
of the limit of the shadow</font>

215
00:18:10,270 --> 00:18:12,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that she measured and followed,</font>

216
00:18:12,940 --> 00:18:19,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but he caught her from behind,
trailed by the shadow she couldn't see...</font>

217
00:18:20,450 --> 00:18:22,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is no escape from this.</font>

218
00:18:22,950 --> 00:18:24,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-It can't be...</font>

219
00:18:26,830 --> 00:18:29,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The attack that he used
with the jacket,</font>

220
00:18:30,130 --> 00:18:33,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was it a device to lead me
to right this spot...?</font>

221
00:18:35,010 --> 00:18:36,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was that an under-plot too?!</font>

222
00:18:38,680 --> 00:18:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why that...?!</font>

223
00:18:40,840 --> 00:18:42,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Checkmate with the next one.</font>

224
00:18:50,900 --> 00:18:54,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My body is moving on its own!
I can't resist it!</font>

225
00:19:07,120 --> 00:19:10,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Before anyone knew it,
they fell under the spell of this match.</font>

226
00:19:10,710 --> 00:19:14,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy with no mark
is quite a darkhorse.</font>

227
00:19:14,420 --> 00:19:17,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes! You did it!</font>

228
00:19:17,840 --> 00:19:20,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go! Shikamaru!</font>

229
00:19:24,100 --> 00:19:24,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Check...</font>

230
00:19:55,840 --> 00:19:58,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good grief... I give up!</font>

231
00:20:07,560 --> 00:20:08,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

232
00:20:13,850 --> 00:20:17,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See I told you... he'd give up.</font>

233
00:20:18,320 --> 00:20:22,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino doesn't know anything
about Shikamaru.</font>

234
00:20:22,570 --> 00:20:24,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What did you say?!</font>

235
00:20:28,490 --> 00:20:31,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've used too much Chakra from Shadow
Possession Jutsu in rapid succession.</font>

236
00:20:31,790 --> 00:20:33,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't hold it another 10 seconds.</font>

237
00:20:36,170 --> 00:20:39,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought of the next trick 200 times.</font>

238
00:20:40,670 --> 00:20:42,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I'm out of time...</font>

239
00:20:47,010 --> 00:20:49,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This has become such a pain.</font>

240
00:20:49,100 --> 00:20:50,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Doing one match is good...</font>

241
00:20:53,480 --> 00:20:54,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That guy is a strange one.</font>

242
00:20:56,270 --> 00:20:58,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The winner is Temari!</font>

